{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium Shopify product carousel section that closely matches the layout and visual structure of the reference image I provided.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    This section must use REAL Shopify product data. Do not hardcode product names, prices, images, URLs, or dummy products. Allow me to select a Shopify collection from the Theme Editor and automatically display products from that collection.
    
    DESIGN STYLE:
    Create a clean, minimal, premium footwear product showcase with a luxury editorial/e-commerce feel.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    - Full-width section.
    - White or very light off-white background.
    - Products displayed horizontally in a slider/carousel.
    - On desktop show approximately 4 products across the screen.
    - Each product card should have equal width and equal height.
    - Add thin 1px vertical divider lines between product cards.
    - No large gaps between cards.
    - Cards should feel like one continuous full-width grid.
    - Avoid rounded product-card containers.
    - No shadows around the cards.
    - Overall appearance should be minimal and sophisticated.
    
    PRODUCT CARD STRUCTURE:
    
    TOP AREA:
    At the top-left corner of selected product cards, allow an optional small rectangular badge.
    
    Examples:
    RESTOCKED
    NEW LAUNCH
    BESTSELLER
    LIMITED
    NEW
    
    Badge design:
    - Small rectangular badge.
    - Uppercase text.
    - Bold compact typography.
    - Minimal padding.
    - Badge color and text color editable from Theme Editor.
    - Each product/block should allow the badge to be enabled or disabled.
    - Badge text should be editable.
    
    Optionally allow a second small decorative label or text near the top-right/top-center area of the card, but keep it disabled by default.
    
    PRODUCT IMAGE:
    - Use the Shopify product featured image dynamically.
    - Product image should occupy the main visual area of the card.
    - Keep plenty of whitespace around the shoe/product.
    - Image should be centered horizontally and vertically.
    - Use object-fit: contain.
    - Do not crop the product.
    - Make the image large enough to feel premium, similar to the reference.
    - Maintain the original image aspect ratio.
    - Add a very subtle hover zoom animation, approximately scale(1.03), with smooth easing.
    - Clicking the product image should open the product page.
    
    PRODUCT INFORMATION:
    Place the product information near the bottom of the card.
    
    Bottom-left:
    - Product title in uppercase.
    - Clean modern sans-serif typography.
    - Medium font weight.
    - Approximately 16–18px on desktop.
    - Under the product title show an optional secondary line.
    
    The secondary line can display:
    - Product subtitle
    - Product type
    - Vendor
    - Metafield
    or custom text.
    
    Make this secondary text:
    - Light grey
    - Smaller than product title
    - Approximately 13–15px
    - Optional from Theme Editor.
    
    Bottom-right:
    Display the Shopify product price.
    
    Example:
    ₹ 5299
    
    Requirements:
    - Use Shopify money formatting.
    - Automatically use the store currency.
    - Do not hardcode ₹.
    - Align the price visually with the product title.
    - Medium/semi-bold font weight.
    - If product has a compare-at price, optionally show the original price with strikethrough and the current price beside it.
    - Add a Theme Editor option to show/hide compare-at price.
    
    CARD HEIGHT:
    The product cards should be tall and editorial, similar to the reference image.
    
    Desktop approximate height:
    450–520px
    
    Structure approximately:
    - Top badge area: 10–15%
    - Product image area: 60–65%
    - Product information area: 20–25%
    
    Keep the product details aligned consistently across every card regardless of image dimensions.
    
    CAROUSEL / SLIDER:
    Create a smooth horizontal product slider.
    
    Desktop:
    - Show 4 products at a time when enough screen width is available.
    - Product width should adapt responsively.
    - Show a circular next arrow button partially overlaying the right side of the section.
    - Show a previous arrow when appropriate.
    - Arrow buttons should be approximately 36–42px.
    - Circular grey background.
    - White arrow icon.
    - Keep arrow design minimal.
    - Hide previous arrow when already at the first slide if possible.
    - Hide next arrow when at the final slide if possible.
    
    Slider behavior:
    - Smooth horizontal movement.
    - Use CSS scroll snap or lightweight vanilla JavaScript.
    - Do NOT use external slider libraries.
    - Do NOT load jQuery.
    - Support mouse drag where possible.
    - Support touch swipe on mobile.
    - Prevent page reload when navigating slider.
    - Slider should remain performant.
    
    OPTIONAL AUTOPLAY:
    Add Theme Editor options for:
    - Enable/disable autoplay
    - Autoplay delay
    - Default autoplay OFF
    
    RESPONSIVE DESIGN:
    
    Desktop 1200px+:
    - Approximately 4 products visible.
    - Thin vertical separators.
    - Large product images.
    
    Tablet:
    - Approximately 2–3 products visible.
    
    Mobile:
    - Display approximately 1.1–1.3 products so part of the next product is visible.
    - Enable horizontal swipe.
    - Keep cards readable.
    - Reduce card height.
    - Product title approximately 14–16px.
    - Price approximately 14–16px.
    - Product image should remain fully visible.
    - Keep vertical separators.
    - Avoid horizontal page overflow
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; background:{{ block.settings.background_color }}; color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}; overflow:hidden; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { display:flex; align-items:end; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; padding:28px 24px 18px; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin:0; font-size:{{ block.settings.heading_size }}px; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:.02em; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport { position:relative; width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { display:flex; overflow-x:auto; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scrollbar-width:none; cursor:grab; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track.is-dragging { cursor:grabbing; scroll-behavior:auto; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { position:relative; flex:0 0 25%; min-width:0; height:{{ block.settings.card_height }}px; padding:14px 18px 20px; border-right:1px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }}; scroll-snap-align:start; box-sizing:border-box; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge { align-self:flex-start; padding:5px 8px; background:{{ block.settings.badge_color }}; color:{{ block.settings.badge_text_color }}; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em; line-height:1; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual { position:relative; flex:1; min-height:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:10px 0; overflow:hidden; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; transition:transform .35s ease; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover img { transform:scale(1.03); }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:#f1f1ef; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { width:70%; height:70%; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info { display:flex; align-items:end; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; min-height:58px; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { margin:0; font-size:16px; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sub { margin:6px 0 0; color:{{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }}; font-size:13px; line-height:1.2; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { white-space:nowrap; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; text-align:right; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare { margin-right:5px; color:{{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }}; font-size:12px; text-decoration:line-through; font-weight:400; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls { display:flex; gap:8px; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { width:40px; height:40px; border:0; border-radius:50%; background:{{ block.settings.arrow_color }}; color:{{ block.settings.arrow_icon_color }}; display:grid; place-items:center; cursor:pointer; }
  .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:disabled { opacity:.35; cursor:not-allowed; }
  @media (max-width:989px) { .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis:33.333%; } }
  @media (max-width:749px) { .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { padding:22px 16px 14px; } .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis:80%; height:{{ block.settings.mobile_card_height }}px; padding:12px 14px 16px; } .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { font-size:15px; } .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { font-size:14px; } .ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size:{{ block.settings.mobile_heading_size }}px; } }
{% endstyle %}

<product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay }}" data-delay="{{ block.settings.autoplay_delay | times: 1000 }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}<h2 class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>{% endif %}
    <div class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls">
      <button class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous products">&#8592;</button>
      <button class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next products">&#8594;</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport">
    <div class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>
      {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
        {% for product in block.settings.collection.products limit: block.settings.products_to_show %}
          <article class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">
            {% if block.settings.show_badge and block.settings.badge_text != blank %}<span class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ block.settings.badge_text }}</span>{% endif %}
            <a class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual" href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="View {{ product.title | escape }}">
              {% if product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}
            </a>
            <div class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info">
              <div><h3 class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ product.title }}</h3>{% if block.settings.show_secondary and block.settings.secondary_source == 'vendor' %}<p class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sub">{{ product.vendor }}</p>{% elsif block.settings.show_secondary and block.settings.secondary_source == 'type' %}<p class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sub">{{ product.type }}</p>{% elsif block.settings.show_secondary and block.settings.secondary_text != blank %}<p class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sub">{{ block.settings.secondary_text }}</p>{% endif %}</div>
              <div class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{% if block.settings.show_compare and product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="ai-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}{{ product.price | money }}</div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}<div style="padding:60px 24px;">Select a collection to display products.</div>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function(){
  class ProductCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback(){
      this.track=this.querySelector('[data-track]'); this.prev=this.querySelector('[data-prev]'); this.next=this.querySelector('[data-next]');
      this.update=()=>{this.prev.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft<=2; this.next.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft+this.track.clientWidth>=this.track.scrollWidth-2;};
      this.prev.onclick=()=>this.track.scrollBy({left:-this.track.clientWidth*.9,behavior:'smooth'}); this.next.onclick=()=>this.track.scrollBy({left:this.track.clientWidth*.9,behavior:'smooth'}); this.track.onscroll=this.update; this.update();
      let down=false,start=0,left=0; this.track.onpointerdown=e=>{down=true;start=e.clientX;left=this.track.scrollLeft;this.track.classList.add('is-dragging');this.track.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)}; this.track.onpointermove=e=>{if(down)this.track.scrollLeft=left-(e.clientX-start)}; this.track.onpointerup=()=>{down=false;this.track.classList.remove('is-dragging')}; this.track.onpointercancel=()=>{down=false;this.track.classList.remove('is-dragging')};
      if(this.dataset.autoplay==='true' && this.track.children.length>4)this.timer=setInterval(()=>{if(!this.next.disabled)this.next.click();else this.track.scrollTo({left:0,behavior:'smooth'})},Number(this.dataset.delay));
    }
    disconnectedCallback(){clearInterval(this.timer)}
  }
  customElements.define('product-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}',ProductCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{"name":"Premium product carousel","settings":[{"type":"collection","id":"collection","label":"Collection"},{"type":"range","id":"products_to_show","label":"Products to show","min":4,"max":24,"step":1,"default":12},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Featured footwear"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"card_height","label":"Card height","min":400,"max":600,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":500},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_card_height","label":"Mobile card height","min":300,"max":500,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":390},{"type":"range","id":"heading_size","label":"Heading size","min":16,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":24},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_heading_size","label":"Mobile heading size","min":14,"max":30,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":20},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_badge","label":"Show badge","default":false},{"type":"text","id":"badge_text","label":"Badge text","default":"NEW"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_secondary","label":"Show secondary line","default":true},{"type":"select","id":"secondary_source","label":"Secondary source","options":[{"value":"vendor","label":"Vendor"},{"value":"type","label":"Product type"},{"value":"custom","label":"Custom text"}],"default":"vendor"},{"type":"text","id":"secondary_text","label":"Custom secondary text","default":"Premium footwear"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_compare","label":"Show compare-at price","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"autoplay","label":"Enable autoplay","default":false},{"type":"range","id":"autoplay_delay","label":"Autoplay delay","min":3,"max":12,"step":1,"unit":"s","default":5},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#F7F3E6"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#011333"},{"type":"color","id":"secondary_text_color","label":"Secondary text","default":"#6E7075"},{"type":"color","id":"divider_color","label":"Dividers","default":"#D7D4CC"},{"type":"color","id":"badge_color","label":"Badge","default":"#68021F"},{"type":"color","id":"badge_text_color","label":"Badge text","default":"#F7F3E6"},{"type":"color","id":"arrow_color","label":"Arrow background","default":"#011333"},{"type":"color","id":"arrow_icon_color","label":"Arrow icon","default":"#F7F3E6"}],"presets":[{"name":"Premium product carousel"}],"tag":null,"class":"premium-product-carousel"}
{% endschema %}